  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RBF in Digitizing the Agricultural Ecosystem</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Smallholder farmers in northern Uganda suffers from low quality inputs that negatively affect their production and productivity. Connected Farmer Plus has been piloted in West Nile and has contributed in bridging the input supply and access to market gaps for the smallholder farmers. Mezzanine and Cordaid is extending the similar services to other districts in northern Uganda.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Smallholder farmers, inputs dealers, financial institutions, off-takers and buyers.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To profile and full data capture for farmers interested in input credit facility or off-taking or both.</narrative>
  </description>
